            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Proctor, Diana M. and Fukuyama, Julia A. and Loomer, Peter M. and Armitage, Gary C. and Lee, Stacey A. and Davis, NM and Ryder, Mark I. and Holmes, Susan P. and Relman, David A.. (2017). A spatial gradient of bacterial diversity in the human oral cavity shaped by salivary flow (second). Stanford Digital Repository. Available at: https://purl.stanford.edu/xr749qy9885",
